### CORS Testing for DepotDirect API
### Test CORS functionality from different localhost origins

### 1. Test simple OPTIONS request (CORS preflight)
OPTIONS http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Authorization

### 2. Test GET request with Origin header (simulating React app on port 3000)
GET http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries/with-stats
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 3. Test GET request with Origin header (simulating Angular app on port 4200)
GET http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries
Origin: http://localhost:4200
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 4. Test POST request with Origin header (simulating Vue app on port 8080)
POST http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries
Origin: http://localhost:8080
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Country",
  "isoCode": "TC",
  "metadata": {
    "test": "cors"
  }
}

### 5. Test with 127.0.0.1 origin (alternative localhost format)
GET http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries
Origin: http://127.0.0.1:3000
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 6. Test public endpoint (no auth required)
GET http://localhost:5204/public/status
Origin: http://localhost:3000

### 7. Test login endpoint with CORS
POST http://localhost:5204/auth/login
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}